  "title": "Lemon Blueberry Pie",
  "description": "Fresh blueberries are gently folded into a lemony batter and poured into a baked pie shell. A lovely meringue is then spooned over the top, and the pie is slipped into a hot oven until golden. This recipe yields two pies.",
  "authors": [
    "Gwen Balkcum"
  ],
